Hi everyone, I had another idea for the MMP stage that could make our app more practical and modern. We could introduce a Digital Student ID feature where each student has a unique QR/barcode inside their profile. This could potentially be used for identification, attendance check-ins, or library verification instead of relying on physical ID cards.

User Story:
As a student, I want to access a digital QR/barcode ID through the app so that I can use it for university identification and academic services conveniently.

We can keep the implementation simple by generating and displaying the code within the profile section. Let me know what you all think about adding this feature.
